div class=\"sig\">G</div><span class=\"b b-ghost\">○ Unclaimed</span><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"nm\">Graskop</div><div class=\"rg\">panorama route</div><div class=\"claim\">+ Claim this town →</div></div></div><div class=\"tc ghost\"><div class=\"strata\"></div><div class=\"sig\">PR</div><span class=\"b b-ghost\">○ Unclaimed</span><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"nm\">Pilgrim&#x27;s Rest</div><div class=\"rg\">heritage town</div><div class=\"claim\">+ Claim this town →</div></div></div><div class=\"tc ghost\"><div class=\"strata\"></div><div class=\"sig\">E</div><span class=\"b b-ghost\">○ Unclaimed</span><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"nm\">Eelands</div><div class=\"rg\">conservation</div><div class=\"claim\">+ Claim this town →</div></div></div><div class=\"tc ghost\"><div class=\"strata\"></div><div class=\"sig\">B</div><span class=\"b b-ghost\">○ Unclaimed</span><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"nm\">Badplaas</div><div class=\"rg\">mineral springs</div><div class=\"claim\">+ Claim this town →</div></div></div><div class=\"tc ghost\"><div class=\"strata\"></div><div class=\"sig\">L</div><span class=\"b b-ghost\">○ Unclaimed</span><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"nm\">Lydenburg</div><div class=\"rg\">heritage town</div><div class=\"claim\">+ Claim this town →</div></div></div></div><p class=\"note\">🛰️ Card skins are generated from each town&#x27;s name and state — pale when unclaimed, warming as a coordinator activates it, fully rendered once Naledi builds the twin. <!-- -->This province is illustrative until its first twin is built<!-- -->.</p></section><section class=\"section\" style=\"padding-top:6px\"><div class=\"spot\"><span class=\"for\">📈<!-- --> For <!-- -->investor<!-- -->s</span><div style=\"display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\"><div class=\"ring\" style=\"--p:9\"><span><b>9</b><small>Avg potential</small></span></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:240px\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:1.4px\">0<!-- --> live · <!-- -->5<!-- --> building · <!-- -->13<!-- --> unclaimed</div><p style=\"color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 12px;font-size:0.88px\">Scored opportunities surface as each town&#x27;s twin renders. <!-- -->No live twin yet — first mover advantage<!-- -->.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#const\">Browse the towns ↓</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" style=\"padding-top:8px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Network</span><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5px;margin:10px 0\">Coordinators in <!-- -->Mpumalanga</h2><p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;margin-bottom:14px\">6<!-- --> active coordinators across the province.</p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));gap:12px\"><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:.82rem;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0\">JS</div><div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:.88rem\">Johannes Steyn</div><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)\">Coordinator · <a href=\"/town/emalahleni\" style=\"color:var(--gold-deep)\">emalahleni</a></div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:.82rem;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0\">SF</div><div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:.88rem\">Sharmane Fortunate Sekatane</div><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)\">Coordinator · <a href=\"/town/bushbuckridge\" style=\"color:var(--gold-deep)\">bushbuckridge</a></div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:.82rem;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0\">TM</div><div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:.88rem\">Thabiso Mokoena</div><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)\">Coordinator · <a href=\"/town/acornhoek\" style=\"color:var(--gold-deep)\">acornhoek</a></div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:.82rem;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0\">NZ</div><div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:.88rem\">Ntando Zwane</div><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)\">Coordinator · <a href=\"/town/sabie\" style=\"color:var(--gold-deep)\">sabie</a></div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:.82rem;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0\">MV</div><div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:.88rem\">Mpumi Vilakazi</div><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)\">Coordinator · <a href=\"/town/witbank\" style=\"color:var(--gold-deep)\">witbank</a></div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:.82rem;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0\">GN</div><div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:.88rem\">Given Nkosi</div><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)\">Coordinator · <a href=\"/town/nelspruit\" style=\"color:var(--gold-deep)\">nelspruit</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" style=\"padding-top:8px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The Ecosystem</span><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5px;margin:10px 0\">Ubuntu Town products across <!-- -->Mpumalanga</h2><p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:0.92px;margin-bottom:18px;max-width:600px\">Every town in <!-- -->Mpumalanga<!-- --> has access to these ecosystem products. Enter a town to claim an opportunity.</p><div class=\"ecogrid\"><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🔧</div><div class=\"en\">FixEasy24</div><div class=\"ed\">Get verified as a service provider — plumber, electrician, handyman</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/acornhoek\">Available in <!-- -->1<!-- --> town<!-- --> →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🛒</div><div class=\"en\">KasiBuy</div><div class=\"ed\">List your spaza or shop on the local marketplace</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"#const\">Browse towns →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">📷</div><div class=\"en\">FrameSouth</div><div class=\"ed\">Become the town&#x27;s photographer — document, prove, earn</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/acornhoek\">Available in <!-- -->1<!-- --> town<!-- --> →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">💻</div><div class=\"en\">AI Café</div><div class=\"ed\">Partner to bring AI and internet access to your community</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/bushbuckridge\">Available in <!-- -->3<!-- --> town<!-- -->s<!-- --> →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">📚</div><div class=\"en\">Ubuntu Academy</div><div class=\"ed\">Free CV and job readiness workshops</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"#const\">Browse towns →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🎵</div><div class=\"en\">Orbit Music</div><div class=\"ed\">Create music with AI — workshops and tools</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"#const\">Browse towns →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🎙️</div><div class=\"en\">Inside.Town</div><div class=\"ed\">Host a podcast — tell your town&#x27;s story</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"#const\">Browse towns →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🏠</div><div class=\"en\">FamilyHouse</div><div class=\"ed\">Host visitors in your home — earn from hospitality</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/nelspruit\">Available in <!-- -->1<!-- --> town<!-- --> →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🌿</div><div class=\"en\">EcoChar</div><div class=\"ed\">5-day charcoal production training — green economy skills</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/bushbuckridge\">Available in <!-- -->3<!-- --> town<!-- -->s<!-- --> →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🍺</div><div class=\"en\">BuntuBar</div><div class=\"ed\">Mobile bar and beverage workshop — events economy</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/bushbuckridge\">Available in <!-- -->3<!-- --> town<!-- -->s<!-- --> →</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The model</span><h2 style=\"margin:12px;font-size:1.6px\">One loop runs every town.</h2><div class=\"loopline\" style=\"justify-content:center;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--ink)\">Signal<span class=\"a\">→</span>Workpack<span class=\"a\">→</span>Proof<span class=\"a\">→</span>Memory<span class=\"a\">→</span>Action</div><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin:16px auto 0\">As coordinators run the loop, towns render — and the province lights up.</p></section></div><footer class=\"site\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"logo\"><div class=\"mark\">🏘️</div><div><div class=\"wm\" style=\"color:var(--creamhi)\">Ubuntu Town</div><div class=\"tg\">Abantu Bo Buntu</div></div></div><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:12px;max-width:660px\">Illustrative Mpumalanga rollout state — town names, regions and districts are real; status, render_pct and potential are demo values until each twin is built. No live twin yet (Free State is the reference build).<!-- --> · light CI · enter.ubuntutown.co.za</p></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><!--$?--><template id=\"B:0\"></template>